{"last_link_id": 6, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [3], "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [416.13433837890625, 585.8191528320312], "pos": [1006.89892578125, 842.9930419921875], "widgets_values": ["（0s–2s）\n镜头从湛蓝的神性光幕深处缓缓推进，空气中悬浮着微亮的蓝色符文光粒，仿佛在迎接某种古老力量的归来。随着镜头靠近，一位冷白皮的精灵少女从光中显现，身穿连衣裙，她拥有神圣般的宁静，银蓝光晕在她的长耳与发丝处轻轻流动。\n\n（2s–4s）\n镜头维持正面轻推近至特写，她缓缓睁开双眼，瞳孔呈淡金蓝色，像承载了远古星辰的记忆。肌肤在圣洁蓝光下冷白且晶莹，表情安静而庄严，如同被命运唤醒的光之使者。\n\n（4s–6s）\n镜头从极轻微的左侧平移到她半侧，蓝色神光自头顶倾洒而下，形成柔和的光瀑。她的发丝随神性气流微微摆动，肩部的光纹缓缓亮起，宛如远古精灵的祝圣印记苏醒。\n\n（6s–10s）\n镜头轻拉至半身，少女缓缓抬起手，空气中的符文光粒被唤起，聚集在她掌心上方。蓝色能量像破晓前的第一道光芒，一点点扩散，周围空气微微震动，显示她正在降临、正在回应召唤。\n", "16:9", "10", 1868961499, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "RH_KlingO1_Text2Video", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_KlingO1_Text2Video"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [374, 615.3631591796875], "pos": [1451.6383056640625, 840.4097900390625], "widgets_values": ["video/ComfyUI", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 3, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "格式"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec"}, "name": "codec", "label": "codec", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "编码器"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5